{"conversation":"sochi","question":"What freq is Sochi tower?","reply":{"answer":"In DCS: Caucasus, the Sochi-Adler tower frequencies are 127.0 MHz VHF, 256.0 MHz UHF, 39.6 MHz low VHF, and 4.05 MHz HF.","ids":["/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-caucasus/#af-sochi-adler"],"topic":["/encyclopedia/locations/sochi/"],"references":[{"id":"/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-caucasus/#af-sochi-adler","title":"Sochi-Adler · DCS: Caucasus"}]},"ms":1346,"passed":true,"revision":"4a624fd75a4bc64720c9780a5854e832cd75ebde"}
{"conversation":"sochi","question":"Does it have a TACAN?","reply":{"answer":"In DCS: Caucasus, the Sochi-Adler airfield has an NDB with marker (CO) and an ILS on runway 06, but a TACAN is not listed in the simulator record.","ids":["/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-caucasus/#af-sochi-adler"],"topic":["/encyclopedia/locations/sochi/"],"references":[{"id":"/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-caucasus/#af-sochi-adler","title":"Sochi-Adler · DCS: Caucasus"}]},"ms":611,"passed":true,"revision":"4a624fd75a4bc64720c9780a5854e832cd75ebde"}
{"conversation":"sochi","question":"What about ILS?","reply":{"answer":"In DCS: Caucasus, there is an ILS on runway 06 at 111.1 MHz (ISO).","ids":["/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-caucasus/#af-sochi-adler","/encyclopedia/locations/sochi/#facilities-title"],"topic":["/encyclopedia/locations/sochi/"],"references":[{"id":"/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-caucasus/#af-sochi-adler","title":"Sochi-Adler · DCS: Caucasus"},{"id":"/encyclopedia/locations/sochi/#facilities-title","title":"Sochi International Airport · Runways and facilities"}]},"ms":1112,"passed":true,"revision":"4a624fd75a4bc64720c9780a5854e832cd75ebde"}
