{"conversation":"table-airfield","question":"What is the tower frequency for Kuweires?","reply":{"answer":"The tower frequencies for Kuweires are VHF 120.5, UHF 251.35, low VHF 39.8, and HF 4.45.","ids":["/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-syria/#af-kuweires"],"topic":["/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-syria/#af-kuweires"],"references":[{"id":"/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-syria/#af-kuweires","title":"Kuweires · DCS: Syria"}]},"ms":1502,"passed":true,"revision":"4a624fd75a4bc64720c9780a5854e832cd75ebde"}
{"conversation":"table-airfield","question":"What runways are available?","reply":{"answer":"The available runways at Kuweires are 10 (095°) / 28 (275°), which are 6,663 ft long.","ids":["/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-syria/#af-kuweires"],"topic":["/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-syria/#af-kuweires"],"references":[{"id":"/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-syria/#af-kuweires","title":"Kuweires · DCS: Syria"}]},"ms":699,"passed":true,"revision":"4a624fd75a4bc64720c9780a5854e832cd75ebde"}
